WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
Antioch, early in the second century.

2
00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:06.010
Its bishop, Ignatius, is arrested.

3
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.240
He is taken towards Rome by
ten soldiers he calls leopards.

4
00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.740
At Smyrna and Troas, he
writes seven letters.

5
00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:18.240
In one, to the church in Rome,
he begs them not to save him.

6
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:22.040
So what was this chained
bishop writing, and why?

7
00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:24.280
In this mission, you'll trace his journey,

8
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:25.960
letter by letter.

9
00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:28.660
Then you'll meet a
teaching he fought hard:

10
00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.630
that Christ only seemed to have a body.

11
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.790
Your mission: find out what
the chained bishop wrote,

12
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.150
and why he begged not to be saved.
